From 11970920fb50aa653612925d2b75b94e2a13e0ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: b1air <dimazzzzz342@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:10:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add zoom: the screen magnified round the cursor

`zoom <factor>|in|out|reset|toggle` draws the screen the cursor is on
from 1 (off) to 10 times larger about the cursor, following it as it
moves, to another screen too; the other screens are drawn as usual.
`in` and `out` go by a quarter, `toggle` between off and 2, and a change
is animated with animation_duration_ms. What is under the cursor is drawn
where it is, so it is what a click goes to, and nothing about input
changes.

Placing windows, popups and the rest does not see the zoom (scenefx's
wlr_scene_set_zoom), so nothing is put in the wrong place while it is
on. get_tree reports it on the root as "zoom", and the screen magnified
as "zoom_output"; a screen going away while magnified is let go.

Needs scenefx with wlr_scene_set_zoom (src/scenefx patch 0004).
